OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FDry with good sunny spells for
OL,6,Fmost through the day but feeling cold.
OL,7,FA few North Sea showers feeding into
OL,8,Fparts of North Yorkshire during the
OL,9,Fafternoon. These showers could turn
OL,10,Fbriefly wintry over the moors. Breezy
OL,11,Ftowards the coast.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FShowers easing this evening
OL,14,Fwith frost developing in places. Then
OL,15,Fpersistent rain spreading
OL,16,Fnortheastwards overnight, reaching all
OL,17,Fparts by Tuesday morning and falling
OL,18,Fas sleet or snow over high ground.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
