OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FA cloudy, cold and wet day
OL,6,Fwith persistent rain and some strong
OL,7,Fwinds. Sleet or snow continuing to
OL,8,Ffall across the Pennines until late
OL,9,Fmorning with some accumulations likely
OL,10,Fhere.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,13,FChangeable, with periods of rain on
OL,14,FWednesday. Eventually drier and
OL,15,Fbrighter on Thursday after early rain.
OL,16,FLargely dry Friday but a chance of
OL,17,Fshowers. Temperatures below normal.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
